{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;No Death in Wild West&quot; is a fast-paced action game where you play as the grim reaper, engaging in parkour and melee combat. Dodge bullets as you slam and slash your way through enemies in this thrilling adventure. With each replay, players strive to optimize their strategy, speeding through the landscape with precision to secure a top rank. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cowboys don\u2019t fear death. In the unforgiving Wild West, the Reaper Raiders, a cowboy gang, wear metal masks as their symbol of their defiance against death. They shun mortality, embarking on a mission to hunt Death itself - the grim reaper. Armed with weapons crafted to vanquish the reaper. however, the reason they can see Death remains a mystery... Little do they know, the entity they seek is none other than you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781570?t=1749944185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781570?t=1749944185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/024e6a17e0fbb327ebe74cab019f89f617d9652b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749944185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781570/024e6a17e0fbb327ebe74cab019f89f617d9652b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749944185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"No Death in Wild West\" features stylized, combat violence with exaggerated comic book-style gore, including vivid blood splashes, ragdoll physics, and brutal melee combat."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;No Death in Wild West&quot; is a fast-paced action game where you play as the grim reaper, engagin